	frequency(integer) : "Bubble frequency" : 2 : "How often bubbles come up, where higher is more often, up to twice a second at 20 or more. If left empty, they come up every 2.5 seconds."
	current(integer) : "Speed of Current" : 0 : "Pushes the bubbles sideways toward the yaw of Pitch Yaw Roll, which is the compass angle. With 0, they rise straight up."
