// A player touching it gets its gravity (players only). Fired by name: On turns it on, Off turns it off, Toggle
// toggles. Reset on leave: the gravity goes back to 1 when the player leaves the brush, dies or turns spectator,
// or when the trigger is turned off or removed while the player is inside.
@SolidClass base(Targetname, Master) = trigger_gravity : "Trigger Gravity"
[
	spawnflags(flags) =
	[
		2 : "Start Off" : 0
		4 : "Reset on leave" : 0
	]
	gravity(string) : "Gravity Multiplier (1.0 default)" : "1.0" : "A multiplier of sv_gravity, so 0.5 is half and 2 is double, and 0.01 gives almost no gravity. If left empty or set to 0, gravity is normal. Without Reset on leave, a player keeps it after leaving, until they touch another trigger_gravity or respawn."
]

